# Client

Follow [DECISIONS.md](../brain/DECISIONS.md) and [CODEMAP.md](../brain/CODEMAP.md).

- Owns connection form, decode, paint, widget-scoped input, coordinate mapping.
- Do not add saved profiles (J4), file transfer, clipboard, or audio.
- TLS and wire types come from `shared/`, not a second protocol.
